Third-party code
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

src/Pokemanager.Formats/ is derived from pk3DS.Core, part of pk3DS:

    pk3DS - ROM editor for 3DS Pokémon games
    https://github.com/kwsch/pk3DS
    Copyright (C) Kaphotics (kwsch) and pk3DS contributors
    Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0

    Imported from upstream commit 6daaca934ca2284a73ab743bf89c848c57cd9de1
    (2026-02-27, "Update to .NET 10") using git subtree.

Local modifications to that code are recorded as separate commits in this
repository's history. In summary:
  - Retargeted from net10.0-windows (WinForms) to plain net10.0.
  - WinForms RichTextBox/ProgressBar progress reporting replaced with
    IProgress<T> in CTR/.
  - Code depending on System.Drawing, the native ETC1Lib.dll or WinForms
    resources is excluded from compilation.
  - GARC.MemGARC.Data made public.

pk3DS itself builds on work by many contributors; see its repository for
their credits.

